name":"Is a sump pump failure the same as sewer backup?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Many endorsements group them together as water that backs up through drains or overflows from a sump. Read the endorsement title and wording on your own policy."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the endorsement limit include water extraction?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Often yes — dry-out and cleanup usually come out of the same limit as repairs, which is why small limits run out fast in finished basements."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can appraisal raise my backup sublimit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Appraisal sets the amount of loss, but the policy limit still caps the payment. It can matter when the true loss is disputed and still under the limit."}}],"@id":"https://ohioinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-workbench/basement-backup-sublimit-calculator/#faq"},{"@type":"WebApplication","name":"Basement Backup Sublimit Calculator","description":"Sewer backup coverage calculator for Ohio basements: see how the water’s cause, your endorsement limit and deductible change what a claim can pay.","url":"https://ohioinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-workbench/basement-backup-sublimit-calculator/","applicationCategory":"FinanceApplication","operatingSystem":"Any","browserRequirements":"Requires JavaScript","isAccessibleForFree":true,"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"0","priceCurrency":"USD"},"provider":{"@id":"https://ohioinsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"@id":"https://ohioinsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-workbench/basement-backup-sublimit-calculator/#webapplication"}]}</script>
